iewpoint to the rest of the sentence. Check the required plain, て, た or negative form before adding the pattern.","formation":"Plain or polite reason clause + から","difficulty":"Core","examples":[{"japanese":"時間がありませんからタクシーで行きます。","romaji":"Jikan ga arimasen kara takushii de ikimasu.","meaning":"Because there is no time, I will go by taxi."}],"common_mistakes":["Do not substitute a nearby expression with a different nuance. Build the verb or clause first, then attach Clause + から as shown in Plain or polite reason clause + から."],"practice_questions":[{"id":"n4-24-meaning","prompt":"What does “Clause + から” mean?","options":["Because / since","Must / have to","Have to","Do not have to"],"answer":"Because / since","explanation":"Clause + から expresses because / since. Use this construction to connect the stated action, condition or viewpoint to the rest of the sentence. Check the required plain, て, た or negative form before adding the pattern."},{"id":"n4-24-formation","prompt":"Choose the correct formation for “Because から”.","options":["ない-form without い + なければならない","ない-form without い + なくてはいけない","ない-form + といけない","Plain or polite reason clause + から"],"answer":"Plain or polite reason clause + から","explanation":"Clause + から expresses because / since. Use this construction to connect the stated action, condition or viewpoint to the rest of the sentence. Check the required plain, て, た or negative form before adding the pattern."},{"id":"n4-24-example","prompt":"Which sentence illustrates “Because から”?","options":["宿題をしなくてはいけません。","もう帰らないといけません。","時間がありませんからタクシーで行きます。","毎日薬を飲まなければなりません。"],"answer":"時間がありませんからタクシーで行きます。","explanation":"時間がありませんからタクシーで行きます。 (Jikan ga arimasen kara takushii de ikimasu.) means “Because there is no time, I will go by taxi.”."},{"id":"n4-24-translation","prompt":"Choose the meaning of: 時間がありませんからタクシーで行きます。","options":["I have to go home now.","Because there is no time, I will go by taxi.","I must take medicine every day.","I have to do my homework."],"answer":"Because there is no time, I will go by taxi.","explanation":"時間がありませんからタクシーで行きます。 (Jikan ga arimasen kara takushii de ikimasu.) means “Because there is no time, I will go by taxi.”."}]},{"jlpt_level":"N4","sort_order":25,"category":"Cause","title":"Because ため","pattern":"Plain clause + ため","meaning":"Because of (formal)","explanation":"Plain clause + ため expresses because of (formal). Use this construction to connect the stated action, condition or viewpoint to the rest of the sentence. Check the required plain, て, た or negative form before adding the pattern.","formation":"Plain clause + ため","difficulty":"Core","examples":[{"japanese":"大雨のため電車が止まりました。","romaji":"Ooame no tame densha ga tomarimashita.","meaning":"The train stopped because of heavy rain."}],"common_mistakes":["Do not substitute a nearby expression with a different nuance. Build the verb or clause first, then attach Plain clause + ため as shown in Plain clause + ため."],"practice_questions":[{"id":"n4-25-meaning","prompt":"What does “Plain clause + ため” mean?","options":["Must / have to","Have to","Do not have to","Because of (formal)"],"answer":"Because of (formal)","explanation":"Plain clause + ため expresses because of (formal). Use this construction to connect the stated action, condition or viewpoint to the rest of the sentence. Check the required plain, て, た or negative form before adding the pattern."},{"id":"n4-25-formation","prompt":"Choose the correct formation for “Because ため”.","options":["ない-form without い + なくてはいけない","ない-form + といけない","Plain clause + ため","ない-form without い + なければならない"],"answer":"Plain clause + ため","explanation":"Plain clause + ため expresses because of (formal). Use this construction to connect the stated action, condition or viewpoint to the rest of the sentence. Check the required plain, て, た or negative form before adding the pattern."},{"id":"n4-25-example","prompt":"Which sentence illustrates “Because ため”?","options":["もう帰らないといけません。","大雨のため電車が止まりました。","毎日薬を飲まなけれ